Based on your interests in Data Science, Computer Science, Programming, and Mathematics, as well as your preference for logical thinking and problem-solving, here are three highly-regarded universities in the UK and EU with relevant Bachelor's programs:

    Imperial College London (UK)[1][2]

+ Program: BEng Computing (Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning)

        Why it fits: Imperial is consistently ranked among the world's best for Computer Science and Engineering. This specific BEng (Bachelor of Engineering) program focuses heavily on AI and Machine Learning, which are core components of Data Science. It provides a strong foundation in computer science principles combined with specialized knowledge, aligning with your top career interest and your enjoyment of programming and mathematics.

    ETH Zurich – Swiss Federal Institute of Technology (Switzerland - Non-EU but top European)

+ Program: BSc Computer Science[3][4]

        Why it fits: ETH Zurich is arguably the top technical university in continental Europe, renowned for its rigorous programs in Computer Science and Engineering. While they don't offer a specific "Data Science" Bachelor's, their core Computer Science BSc is exceptionally strong and provides the fundamental mathematical and programming skills essential for Data Science. Many graduates pursue Master's degrees in Data Science or AI afterwards. The program is taught in German for the first year, switching mainly to English later, but English proficiency is crucial, and many resources are available in English. Note: Initial years require German language proficiency.

    University of Edinburgh (UK)[1][2][5]

+ Program: BSc Computer Science and Mathematics

        Why it fits: Edinburgh has a world-class School of Informatics (Computer Science) and a strong Mathematics department. This joint honours degree directly combines your stated interests in programming and mathematics. It provides a deep theoretical understanding alongside practical computing skills, making it an excellent pathway towards a career in Data Science or advanced Computer Science roles. The university is highly ranked for both Computer Science and Data Science.